之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,66,80,73,71,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,66,80,73,71,80],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10162","city":"CS1008","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,66,80,73,71,80],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","horse":"WP29018"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1001460","name":{"zh":"白马巾帼","en":"Heroine on a White Horse"},"year":"199","month":"10","desc":{"zh":"公孙瓒死后，公孙玥继续在北疆率领少量白马义从抗击胡人......\n\n禁忌条件：主角为公孙玥、阎柔、田畴时无法触发。\n\n亲历条件：【公孙玥、阎柔、田畴存活，公孙瓒、刘虞死亡】，【公孙玥为在野状态】，【与公孙玥的关系等级至少为3级】，【与田畴的关系等级小于2级】，【与阎柔的关系等级小于2级或主角为曹操】。\n\n逆天改命：【收公孙玥、阎柔、田畴为家将】","en":"Following Gongsun Zan's death, Gongsun Yue continues to lead a small band of White Horse Volunteers on the northern frontier to resist the Hu barbarians...\n\n\n\nIncompatible Conditions: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, or Tian Chou.\n\n\n\nParticipation Requirements: 【Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, and Tian Chou are alive, Gongsun Zan and Liu Yu are dead】, 【Gongsun Yue is Free】, 【Relationship level with Gongsun Yue is at least Level 3】, 【Relationship level with Tian Chou is below Level 2】, 【Relationship level with Yan Rou is below Level 2, or the protagonist is Cao Cao】.\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Recruit Gongsun Yue, Yan Rou, and Tian Chou as Retainers】"}},{"kind":"plot","id":"1009908","name":{"zh":"田畴仕官改仕","en":"Tian Chou changes allegiances to Serve"},"year":"192","month":"6","desc":{"zh":"","en":""}}],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年著名隐士、谋士。起初为刘虞的幕僚，刘虞死后他率二十骑潜入公孙瓒领地，夺回首级并守孝三年，率宗族数百人隐居。因痛恨异族乌丸烧杀抢掠而助曹操奇袭乌桓。曹操北征受阻于泥泞时，田畴献“改道卢龙塞”之计，断言“掩其不备，蹋顿之首可不战而禽”。此计使曹军穿越五百里无人区，直捣乌桓腹地，最终斩杀蹋顿，奠定北方统一基础。事后因为功绩和忠义被封为议郎，但却拒绝曹操的任用。","tc":"東漢末年著名隱士、謀士。起初為劉虞的幕僚，劉虞死后他率二十騎潛入公孫瓚領地，奪回首級并守孝三年，率宗族數百人隱居。因痛恨異族烏丸燒殺搶掠而助曹操奇襲烏桓。曹操北征受阻于泥濘時，田疇獻“改道盧龍塞”之計，斷言“掩其不備，蹋頓之首可不戰而禽”。此計使曹軍穿越五百里無人區，直搗烏桓腹地，最終斬殺蹋頓，奠定北方統一基礎。事后因為功績和忠義被封為議郎，但卻拒絕曹操的任用。","en":"A famous recluse and strategist of the late Eastern Han. He initially served as an adviser to Liu Yu. After Liu Yu's death, he led twenty riders into Gongsun Zan's territory to recover his lord's severed head and observed three years of mourning, then lived in seclusion with several hundred clansmen. Out of hatred for the Wuhuan's raids and pillaging, he assisted Cao Cao in launching a surprise attack on the Wuhuan. When Cao Cao's northern expedition was bogged down in the mud, Tian Chou presented the plan of ‘rerouting via Lulong Pass’, asserting, ‘Catch them unprepared, and Tadun's head can be taken without a fight.’ This plan allowed Cao Cao's army to traverse five hundred li of wilderness and strike straight into the Wuhuan heartland, ultimately slaying Tadun and laying the foundation for the unification of the north. Afterward, on account of his merit and loyalty, he was appointed Court Counselor, but he declined Cao Cao's appointments.","jp":"後漢末期の高名な隠士、謀士。初めは劉虞の幕僚を務め、劉虞の死後は二十騎を率いて公孫瓚の領地に潜入し首級を奪還、三年の喪に服した後に一族数百人を率いて隠棲した。異民族である烏丸の略奪を深く憎んでいたため、曹操による烏桓奇襲に協力した。曹操の北征が悪路と泥濘に阻まれた際、田疇は「盧竜塞へと迂回する」策を献策し、「不意を突けば、戦わずして蹋頓の首級を得られましょう」と断言した。この策によって曹操軍は五百里に及ぶ無人地帯を踏破して烏桓の本拠地を直撃し、最終的に蹋頓を討ち取って北方統一の基礎を築いた。事後、その功績と忠義により議郎に任じられたが、曹操からの仕官の誘いは固辞した。","kr":"동한 말기의 저명한 은사이자 모사이다. 처음에 유우의 막료로 있었으며, 유우가 죽자 20기를 이끌고 공손찬의 영지에 잠입하여 수급을 되찾아 삼년상을 치른 뒤 종족 수백 명을 이끌고 은거하였다. 이민족 오환의 살육과 약탈을 증오하여 조조를 도와 오환을 기습하였다. 조조의 북벌이 진흙탕에 가로막혔을 때 전주는 '노룡새로 우회하는' 계책을 올리며 '방비하지 못한 틈을 노린다면 싸우지 않고도 답돈의 목을 밸 수 있습니다'라고 단언하였다. 이 계책으로 조조군은 500리의 무인지경을 돌파해 오환의 심장부로 직행하였고, 마침내 답돈을 참수하여 북방 통일의 기틀을 마련하였다. 사후에 공적과 충의로 의랑에 봉해졌으나 조조의 등용을 거절하였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10312","remark":"","surname":"田","surnameTc":"田","surnameEn":"Tian","surnameJp":"田","surnameKr":"전","surnameOther":"","name":"畴","nameTc":"疇","nameEn":"Chou","nameJp":"疇","nameKr":"주","nameOther":"","word":"子泰","wordTc":"子泰","wordEn":"Zitai","wordJp":"子泰","wordKr":"자태","wordOther":"","icon":"田畴","power":"WJ10162","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1008","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"66","wise":"80","politics":"73","charm":"71","will":"80","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"21/21/71/21/21/84/30/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1004801;1005105","warSoul":"S1002205","battleSoul":"1020605","debateSoul":"1001205","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"6400","strategy":"1004408","strategy2":"1002105","professions":"0/0/3/1/0/0/1/1/3/3/2/0/2/2/2/1/3/2/4/1/0/2/3/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"28","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14200","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"169","show":"188","death":"216","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","treasure":"","horse":"WP29018","shield":"","character":"2/1;8/1;12/2;18/1;21/2;31/2;58/1;45/2;27/2;59/2;9/0","father":"","mother":"","chil